00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:14.400
DR. FAUCI: ON THE ADVICE OF

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:15.000
COUNSEL, I RESPECTFULLY DECLINE

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:15.400
TO ANSWER BASED

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:16.000
UPON MY RIGHTS UNDER THE FIFTH

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:23.000
