00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:26.900
CHAIR PAUL: THE CHAIRMAN HAS

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:28.600
DENIED YOUR ASSERTION OF

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:30.600
PRIVILEGE AND DIRECTED YOU TO

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:31.900
ANSWER BUT YOU NONETHELESS

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:34.000
