THE COMMITTEE WILL HAVE TO

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:38.900
CONSIDER AFTER THIS HEARING MORE

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:40.700
APPROPRIATE ACTION SHOULD BE

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:41.300
TAKEN AGAINST YOU FOR THE

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:43.000
FAILURE TO TESTIFY AFTER BEING

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:44.200
DIRECTED TO DO SO.

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:46.800
IT IS AGAINST THE LAW TO

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:47.400
OBSTRUCT AN INVESTIGATION OF

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:49.200
CONGRESS.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:50.500
THERE WILL BE REPERCUSSIONS TO

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:52.100
REFUSAL TO TESTIFY TODAY.

00:00:52.100 --> 00:01:02.500
SENATOR PETERS?

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:06.800
YOU ARE NOT RECOGNIZED.

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:07.900
IF YOU'RE UNRULY YOU WILL BE

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:10.100
REMOVED FROM THE PROCEEDING.

00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:12.100
YOU ARE NOT RECOGNIZED.

00:01:12.100 --> 00:01:15.900
SIR, YOU ARE NOT RECOGNIZED.

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:19.300
SECURITY?

00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:22.200
