YOU WERE TOLD NOT TO SIT AT THE

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:29.200
TABLE, YOU INSIST ON SITTING AT

00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:30.700
THE TABLE WE TOLD YOU YOU WOULD

00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:31.600
NOT BE RECOGNIZED.

00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:32.700
YOU ARE NOT INVITED HERE FOR

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:35.700
